    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586520/extras/268fcd7d6ca3cbc82277617d64c9333d.avif?t=1746681875\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A call for help within a mysterious messaging app. Someone lost and wandering through a forest in a faraway place. And their destiny in your hands.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beek: How I Became a Familiar Spirit and Everything After That</strong> is a text-based narrative experience from the creators of Nekojishi. Featuring dozens of branching paths, multiple endings, and CG's to unlock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586520/extras/0506a0776acc0efcff228ecbc9f6ad39.poster.avif?t=1746681875\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586520/extras/0506a0776acc0efcff228ecbc9f6ad39.webm?t=1746681875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586520/extras/0506a0776acc0efcff228ecbc9f6ad39.mp4?t=1746681875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Beek seek a way home, and face the darkness of this world with strength and courage.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586520/extras/268fcd7d6ca3cbc82277617d64c9333d.avif?t=1746681875\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A call for help within a mysterious messaging app. Someone lost and wandering through a forest in a faraway place. And their destiny in your hands.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beek: How I Became a Familiar Spirit and Everything After That</strong> is a text-based narrative experience from the creators of Nekojishi. Featuring dozens of branching paths, multiple endings, and CG's to unlock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586520/extras/0506a0776acc0efcff228ecbc9f6ad39.poster.avif?t=1746681875\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586520/extras/0506a0776acc0efcff228ecbc9f6ad39.webm?t=1746681875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586520/extras/0506a0776acc0efcff228ecbc9f6ad39.mp4?t=1746681875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Beek seek a way home, and face the darkness of this world with strength and courage.</p>",
